        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: David Thewlis, Patty Jenkins, Allan Heinberg, Zack Snyder, Jason Fuchs, Gal Gadot, Chris Pine, Robin Wright, Danny Huston, Connie Nielsen, Elena Anaya, Rosa Tran\n- Works: James and the Giant Peach, The Miracle Maker, Anomalisa, Fargo, Wonder Woman\n- Organizations: FX, Academy Awards\n- Concepts: anthology television format\n\nFacts:\n- David Thewlis did voice work in James and the Giant Peach in 1996.\n- David Thewlis did voice work in The Miracle Maker in 2000.\n- Fargo premiered on FX on April 15, 2014.\n- Fargo uses an anthology format, with each season set in a different era and featuring a different story and mostly new characters and cast, with minor overlap.\n- David Thewlis did voice work in Anomalisa in 2015.\n- In 2016, Rosa Tran was nominated for the Academy Award for Best Animated Feature at the 88th Academy Awards for producing Anomalisa.\n- Wonder Woman is directed by Patty Jenkins, with a screenplay by Allan Heinberg from a story by Allan Heinberg, Zack Snyder, and Jason Fuchs.\n- Wonder Woman stars Gal Gadot, Chris Pine, Robin Wright, Danny Huston, David Thewlis, Connie Nielsen, and Elena Anaya.",
